-- Baseline. Written to be safe on three kinds of database:
--   1. a new, empty one;
--   2. one whose tables were created by the server's old startup DDL (every statement is a no-op);
--   3. an early one from before `deadline_at` and `controller_state` existed (they are added here).
-- Later migrations are generated by drizzle-kit and are not hand-edited.
